plan = "Active, 3 AP, 5 Energy, range: rank. Regeneration for 3 turns of (10% + 5% x rank) of the recipient's max HP, + the caster's cha mod. Strength decays 5% per tile beyond 1 from the caster, with no decay when paid entirely with mana. Is the decay fixed when cast, and is the spelling on purpose?"
